164
00:27:02,002 --> 00:27:05,222
ららら...
(La la la...)

165
00:27:09,242 --> 00:27:13,182
のーばでぃーくりすます
No-body Christmas!

166
00:27:34,118 --> 00:27:36,618
[Title: Watch Me]

167
00:27:40,382 --> 00:27:43,822
巡り合う糸はきっと
The thread that brings us together is surely...

168
00:27:43,822 --> 00:27:47,502
絡まるようになってる
bound to become intertwined.

169
00:27:47,502 --> 00:27:51,002
リアルで感じる熱は
The passion felt in reality...

170
00:27:51,002 --> 00:27:54,262
本物の誘惑
