177
00:28:39,618 --> 00:28:44,918
駆け抜けて 天使の微笑みドキドキさせて
dash through, making our angel smiles set your heart racing,

178
00:28:44,918 --> 00:28:49,918
これでもうおんなじだね
even then, we're still the same, right?

179
