ドキドキ高鳴る心は 追いつけずいたずらに微笑む君がいて 繰り出して届けた
Heart pounding faster, still can't keep up, with you smiling mischievously, reaching out and delivering it!

183
00:29:18,118 --> 00:29:24,618
奇跡の魔法みたいにずっと 友達はいつでも忘れない思い出を広げて
Like a miraculous spell, spreading unforgettable memories of friendship forever,

184
