193
00:30:25,934 --> 00:30:29,634
ダンス！ 踊ろうよ飛び込んで
Dance! Jump right in and dance!

194
00:30:29,634 --> 00:30:35,934
天使の微笑み ドキドキさせて これでもお外と同じだね
Making your heart race with an angel's smile, is this still the same as outside?

195
